    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald are delighted to present this well-maintained 3-bedroom semi-detached home with conservatory extension to rear to the market. Ideally positioned in the popular Riverside development in Clonshaugh, this property offers bright and spacious accommodation in a mature residential setting. This home offers an ideal opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors alike.\n\nThis home stands out for large private driveway providing off-street parking for up to three cars and a generous shared side entrance with car access to rear garden. Well cared for and maintained, the property features gas-fired central heating, uPVC double glazed windows and a fitted alarm. The accommodation briefly comprises entrance porch, hallway, living room, dining room and a bright kitchen, full width conservatory extension that also has a guest wc for the ground floor.. Upstairs there are three generously sized bedrooms and a modern shower room. The property also enjoys a low-maintenance rear garden, with a large block built shed ideal for home gym / home office / study / workshop or storage.\n\nRiverside Park enjoys an excellent location in Clonshaugh, a mature and well-established neighbourhood with a strong sense of community. Residents benefit from a wide range of local amenities including shops, cafés, and supermarkets, with Clarehall Shopping Centre and Northside Shopping Centre just minutes away. The surrounding area also offers plenty of leisure and recreational facilities, including parks, sports clubs, and coastal walks, ensuring a convenient and well-rounded lifestyle. The area is well-served by both primary and secondary schools, making it an ideal choice for families. For commuters, there are excellent transport links with several Dublin Bus routes nearby, while the M1, M50, and Dublin Airport are all easily accessible."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPorch - 0.8m x 1.8m\nEntrance porch with tiled flooring and sliding glass door access.\n\nHall - 2.8m x 1.8m\nWelcoming entrance hallway with laminate timber-effect flooring and convenient under-stairs storage.\n\nLiving Room - 3.46m x 4.1m\nSpacious living room featuring a large front picture window, TV point and coal effect gas fireplace. Finished with laminate timber-effect flooring, and decorative ceiling coving.\n\nDining Room - 4.08m x 3.6m\nDining room featuring a coal-effect gas fire, laminate timber-effect flooring, and decorative ceiling coving.\n\nKitchen - 4.0m x 2.3m\nShaker-style fitted kitchen featuring a gas cooker, provisions for washing machine and dishwasher, and a glass door providing access to the conservatory.\n\nConservatory - 3.4m x 5.6m\nThe conservatory is finished with tiled flooring and provides access to the rear garden through French doors.\n\nGuest WC - 1.9m x 1.0m\nGuest WC featuring a wash hand basin with integrated storage cabinet, and finished with tiled flooring.\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLanding - \nThe landing features convenient pull-down access to the attic.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.0m x 3.9m\nGenerous double bedroom to the rear featuring a large rear-facing window, built-in wardrobes, and laminate effect timber flooring.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.44m x 3.2m\nDouble bedroom to the front with built-in wardrobes, laminate effect timber flooring. and a rear-facing window overlooking the garden.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.4m x 2.7m\nSingle bedroom to the front with laminate effect timber flooring and a front-facing window.\n\nShower Room - 2.0m x 2.0m\nFully tiled shower room featuring a corner rain shower, wash hand basin with integrated storage cabinet, and am extractor fan.\n\nOutside - \n\n\nFront Garden - \nWalled, driveway for off-street parking for up to three cars plus gravel patio and flowerbeds on either side with the added convenience of a gated side entrance.\n\nRear Garden - \nPrivate walled rear garden featuring a paved patio and a block-built shed ideal for home office / home gym /workshop with lights, sockets and plumbing at approx. 6.45m x 4.55m.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
